+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns a new JSON value without changing either input. Object members merge recursively, `null`
+removes an object member, and a non-object patch replaces the complete target.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const updated = applyMergePatch(
+  { profile: { name: "Ada", role: "admin" } },
+  { profile: { role: null, team: "platform" } },
+);
+// { profile: { name: "Ada", team: "platform" } }
+```
