+
+Implement RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch support. Export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from
+`src/index.ts`. It must apply object members recursively, remove members whose patch value is
+`null`, replace a target for non-object patches, and leave the supplied target and patch values
+unmodified. Add deterministic coverage for the RFC examples and edge cases.
